  "question": {
    "text": "A parallel plate capacitor of capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> is connected to a battery of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;A dielectric slab of dielectric constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> is now inserted into the space between plates of capacitor while the battery remain connected. The change in the electrostatic energy in the capacitor will be __________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>.</mo></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Initially<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>200</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br />Finally<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>200</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>"
  }
